namespace UObjectToolTips

UIListView {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIListView.h#UIListView
    src   "SUPERSEDED by UDreamListView (`Native.List`) for new work. Kept for the assets that use it,\nand still the only road to a TILE view -- UUITileView derives from it and the control library\nhas no equivalent.\n\nUDreamListView does not compose this class, and the reasons are recorded in its header rather\nthan repeated here: the unit is a UObject*, a cell needs a live world and an already-arranged\nviewport, the pool is sized by visible count rather than source count, and Awake hands the\ndata-source seat to whoever claimed it first. None of those are defects; they are what a\nrecycling stack costs, and a control that must also work in a headless test and in an\nauthoring tree cannot pay them."
    text  "新项目请改用UDreamListView（`Native.List`），此类已被取代。为使用它的资产保留，\n并且它仍是进入TILE视图的唯一途径——UUITileView由它派生，而控件库\n没有对应实现。\n\nUDreamListView不组合此类，原因记录在其头文件中，而非\n在此重复：单元是UObject*，单元格需要活动世界和已排布好的\n视口，池按可见数量而非源数量确定大小，Awake会把\n数据源席位交给最先占用它的对象。这些都不是缺陷；它们是\n回收栈的代价，而一个还必须在无头测试和\n编辑树中工作的控件无法承担这些代价。"
    state machine
}

UITreeView {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Interaction/UIListView.h#UITreeView
    src   "SUPERSEDED by UDreamTreeView (`Native.TreeView`). Kept for the assets that use it. Same story\nas UUIListView above -- the control flattens its own source and owns its rows."
    text  "已由UDreamTreeView（`Native.TreeView`）取代。为使用它的资产保留。情况与\n上面的UUIListView相同——该控件会展平自身的数据源并自行持有其行。"
    state machine
}
